    2 H      0.251630     0.118880 -0.069089  0.017665     0.077065 -0.035512  0.025833  0.016364 -0.015017 -0.093430
    3 H      0.251630    -0.119273 -0.068409  0.017665     0.077672  0.035278 -0.025918  0.015757 -0.014869 -0.093429
